01:47:39.460 --> 01:47:42.740
I agree that the acoustics there aren't great and probably

01:47:42.980 --> 01:48:02.730
zooming from there. In your case, having to type up the minutes makes it even a little more difficult. So we won't head that way in the immediate future anyhow. Thank you. I do think there's some merit to what Jim was talking about, about having some people meet together and some people Zoom, but we're not at that point yet either.

